    "id": "http-client-retry-on-econnrefused",
    "subject": "http-client immediately fails on ECONNREFUSED — no retry for transient startup race",
    "status": "pending",
    "description": "lib/http-client.js: on ECONNREFUSED, immediately rejects with hint message. When game is starting up, there's a race window. A single retry after 500ms would eliminate false 'bridge not running' errors during launch.",
    "blocking": [],
    "blockedBy": [],
    "effort": "small",
    "category": "feature",
    "acceptance": [
      "on ECONNREFUSED, retry once after 500ms before rejecting",
      "second ECONNREFUSED produces the hint error",
      "no retry for other errors (ETIMEDOUT, etc.)"
    ],
    "edge_cases": [
      "retry should not apply to ping() — ping is intentionally a single fast probe"
    ]
